> know exactly why you're not getting interviews.

**[→ try it live](https://hirematch-ai.vercel.app)**

---

### the gist

paste a job description. drop your resume. get scored.

- match score (0–100%)
- missing keywords
- skill gap bars
- bullet point rewriter
- tailored cover letter
- every application tracked
- patterns across applications → which keywords keep blocking you

---

### built with

`gemini 2.0 flash` · `supabase` · `vercel` · `vanilla js` · `no framework noise`

---

### run it yourself

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Nion9/hirematch-ai.git
```

1. spin up a supabase project · run `supabase-setup.sql`
2. grab a free gemini key at [aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com)
3. drop credentials into the html files
4. push to vercel · add `GEMINI_API_KEY` env var
5. ship

---

### why

i got rejected too many times without ever knowing why.

so i built the thing that tells you.

